{
  "projects": {
    "default": "cosmicself-prod",
    "prod": "cosmicself-prod",
    "staging": "cosmicself-staging",
    "dev": "cosmicself-dev"
  },
  "_comment": [
    "Three-environment topology. Replace the project IDs above with your",
    "actual Firebase project IDs:",
    "  - cosmicself-prod    : production traffic",
    "  - cosmicself-staging : pre-prod, RC test entitlements, App Check off",
    "  - cosmicself-dev     : developer sandbox, emulators-equivalent",
    "",
    "Switch the active project locally with:",
    "  firebase use staging",
    "  firebase use prod",
    "",
    "GitHub Actions selects the target via FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID per branch",
    "(see .github/workflows/deploy.yml). Each project has its own service",
    "account JSON in repo secrets:",
    "  FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PROD",
    "  FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_STAGING",
    "",
    "Client config (apiKey, etc.) is per-project too. EAS build profiles",
    "should set EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_* per environment so the right project",
    "is targeted at runtime."
  ]
}
